  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Changes since version 0.2.0:\n\t\t\t- Added XML documentation to generated dispose members and the generated _isDisposed field.\n\t\t\t- Added ThrowIfDisposed() generation with the new DisposableAttribute.GenerateThrowIfDisposed option, including inheritance-aware overrides.\n\t\t\t- Changed generated Dispose(bool) and DisposeAsyncCore() methods to use early-return guards when already disposed.\n\t\t\t- Added support for blank lines between generated members for improved readability.\n\t\t\t- Improved async dispose generation and inheritance handling, including OverrideDisposeAsyncCore scenarios.\n\t\t\t- Added RITDG001 to report an error when a type annotated with [Disposable] is not declared partial.\n\t\t\t- Added HasUnmanagedResources and ExplicitInterfaceImplementation support.",
